### ============================================================================
### Consulta de RNC / cedula -> /api/rnc/consulta
### Servicio externo (rnc.megaplus.com.do), no toca la DB. Modulo RBAC 'unidades'.
### 200 encontrado · 404 no inscrito · 422 formato · 502 servicio no disponible
### ============================================================================

### RNC existente (Gratex) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8000/api/rnc/consulta?rnc=131256432
X-API-KEY: 7a775f6fb0d5ccab15cf149d2c60f15c

### Con guiones: se limpian antes de consultar (el servicio solo acepta digitos) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8000/api/rnc/consulta?rnc=131-25643-2
X-API-KEY: 7a775f6fb0d5ccab15cf149d2c60f15c

### No inscrito como contribuyente -> 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/rnc/consulta?rnc=999999999
X-API-KEY: 7a775f6fb0d5ccab15cf149d2c60f15c

### Formato invalido (8 digitos) -> 422, sin llamar al servicio externo
GET http://localhost:8000/api/rnc/consulta?rnc=12345678
X-API-KEY: 7a775f6fb0d5ccab15cf149d2c60f15c

### Alta de cliente SIN telefono ni correo (lo normal tras consultar el RNC) -> status true
POST http://localhost:8000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: 7a775f6fb0d5ccab15cf149d2c60f15c

{
  "rnc": "131256432",
  "client_name": "GRATEX",
  "company_name": "GRATEX EIRL"
}
